[17.181956, "o", "echo '===== README ====='; nl -ba README.md; echo '===== CURRENT RESULT ====='; cat output/result.json; echo '===== SIZES ====='; for f in data/*.csv.gz; do printf '%s: ' \"$f\"; gzip -cd \"$f\" | wc -l; done\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[17.182058, "o", "===== README =====\r\n"]
[17.183759, "o", "     1\t# EXP-2291 readout\r\n     2\t\r\n     3\tReadout pipeline for experiment EXP-2291 (\"related items v2\" on product pages). The plan it must follow is\r\n     4\t`EXPERIMENT.md`.\r\n     5\t\r\n     6\tRun it from this folder:\r\n"]
[17.183798, "o", "     7\t\r\n     8\t    python -m abtest.report --data data --out output/result.json\r\n     9\t\r\n    10\tLayout:\r\n    11\t\r\n    12\t| Path | What it is |\r\n"]
[17.183849, "o", "    13\t|---|---|\r\n    14\t| `abtest/load.py` | reads the four export files, parses timestamps to UTC, drops repeated assignment rows and pre-assignment pageviews |\r\n    15\t| `abtest/filters.py` | the population filter: applies the platform's bot screening (`bot_flags.csv.gz`) to both arms |\r\n    16\t| `abtest/stats.py` | statistics for the readout: the delta-method interval and the SRM test |\r\n    17\t| `abtest/report.py` | the command: per-user clicks and pageviews, the readout, `result.json`; a click is a pageview's `clicked` value, the module click flag |\r\n    18\t| `data/` | the EXP-2291 export: `assignments.csv.gz`, `bot_flags.csv.gz`, `pageviews.csv.gz`, `module_clicks.csv.gz` |\r\n    19\t| `docs/` | the data platform's documentation of the export (`DATA_DICTIONARY.md`, `TRACKING.md`, `BOT_SCREENING.md`) and the launch record of EXP-2291 (`LAUNCH_EXP-2291.md`) |\r\n    20\t| `output/result.json` | the last readout |\r\n"]
[17.183889, "o", "    21\t| `PM_NOTE.md` | the PM's note about this readout |\r\n    22\t\r\n    23\tEvery experiment export from the data platform has the same four files and columns, so the same command is used for\r\n    24\tother experiments with `--data <their folder>`.\r\n"]
[17.184127, "o", "===== CURRENT RESULT =====\r\n"]
[17.185123, "o", "{\r\n  \"experiment\": \"EXP-2291\",\r\n  \"n_users\": {\r\n    \"A\": 16570,\r\n    \"B\": 15722\r\n  },\r\n  \"pageviews\": {\r\n    \"A\": 165646,\r\n    \"B\": 158616\r\n  },\r\n  \"clicks\": {\r\n    \"A\": 16837,\r\n    \"B\": 16466\r\n  },\r\n  \"ctr\": {\r\n    \"A\": 0.10164447073880443,\r\n    \"B\": 0.1038104604831795\r\n  },\r\n  \"diff\": 0.0021659897443750686,\r\n  \"rel_lift\": 0.021309469453985427,\r\n  \"ci_95\": [\r\n    -0.0033131556717745413,\r\n    0.007645135160524679\r\n  ],\r\n  \"ci_method\": \"delta method, users as the unit\",\r\n  \"srm_p\": 2.3702703557471535e-06,\r\n  \"srm_flag\": true,\r\n  \"decision\": \"invalid\"\r\n}\r\n"]
